{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（22日）上午7時半，西環西營盤第三街廣豐台的保安員報案，指懷疑一名女子由高處墮下，倒臥平台。</p><p>人員到場經檢驗證實女事主當場身亡，現正調查其身份及墮樓原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"女子倒臥屋苑平台不治。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260822/1167757200811102208056124.jpeg/eUJHo83zsxePFdDMlb88Qfpt4MGytBTs2VEhG9lRIRs\"/><figcaption>女子倒臥屋苑平台不治。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女子倒臥屋苑平台不治。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260822/1167757336282927104504673.jpeg/p_-LrOanjNJ8duOti-9gsaZP4t_feDg-VBroiVQa6Ik\"/><figcaption>女子倒臥屋苑平台不治。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T01:19:16.108659+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}